window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He was my demon when I was a child.</b></p> <p>A hellish force protecting me from the evil that hid in the dark and preyed on the weak. But I’m not that innocent girl anymore. And he’s no longer my savior.</p> <p>Filled with such cruelty, such madness, my survival instincts tell me I should run the other way. But how can I when my madness matches his own? When his darkness sings to mine?</p> <p>What happens when two lost souls are just meant to be? When their ugly scars fit so perfectly together?</p> <p>Some matches, like my sister’s, are created in love…</p> <p>Other matches are just plain deadly.</p> <p><i>Deadly Match</i> is the second book in the Deadly Love Series. Each book follows a different set of characters and can be enjoyed as a standalone but are best listened to in order.</p>"; 
